# Architecture boundaries

- Ola 1: UI + mocks only. No real DB, IdP RBAC, or adapters.
- Ola 2: Maak API on Fargate; FaceBinding + SICLI adapters; SQS later.
- Do not add Account/SPEI surfaces “for completeness.”
- Rules: in-app SM (+ SQS later), not Camunda — `docs/adr/ADR-001_Rules_Engine_Light.md`.
- Diagram/detail: `docs/engineering/ARCHITECTURE.md`.
